            "slot": "s196",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · “What Happened? Why Am I Always So Tired",
            "text": "“What Happened? Why Am I Always So Tired, Inflamed… And Feel So&nbsp;Old?”",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s197",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · It’s not your imagination, your body’s d",
            "text": "It’s not your imagination, your body’s declining for a reason. It’s our food. <span><strong>It’s&nbsp;dead.</strong></span> Our food supply is mostly fake - depleted of all its important vitamins and minerals. It’s on purpose too. Big Food Corporations are always looking for cheaper ways to produce their “food-like” products.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s201",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · It’s profits over people!",
            "text": "It’s profits over people!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s202",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The lack of real, whole foods, void of a",
            "text": "The lack of real, whole foods, void of any nutrition, is causing a rapid decline in people’s health. This is especially true in low-income, black communities.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s203",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Eating processed, fake-foods causes our ",
            "text": "Eating processed, fake-foods causes our muscles, joints and organs to inflame. Processed foods also destroy our gut-health, feed bacteria, &amp; ignite an internal inflammatory wildfire. This inflammatory wildfire burns your cells, organs and arteries alive… aging you way faster than Mother Nature or Father Time intended.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
